  "because": "Rules re-read from primary platform pages on 2026-10-24 by the brand-presence thread. Each rule names its evidence record (x-evidence.record, a platform-terms record in 561-group-services-section data/records/platform-terms-records/) and, per field, whether that field is verified, partial, unverified, not-stated or our own policy (own-policy: a cap or window we choose inside the platform limit). Platforms without a rule here (facebook-page, discord, newsletter, website, hive) keep their seed rule, which is unverified. A platform that prohibits automation is mode prohibited or manual-only; the engine never drives it.",
